# Reader trace: ISO SELECT probes, native SELECT, GetKeySettings, MFP probe.
#
# Generated from tests/test_dfc_virtual_picc_probe_vectors.c
# (/trace-reader-sequence-handles-get-key-settings-and-mfp-probe) by recording
# the exchanges the reference engine performed, then cross-checked: all 6 byte
# expectations asserted by that test matched the recording exactly, as did the
# selected-application assertion (kept below as an assert step).
#
# This test drives the frame-level API, so the steps are frame-exchange and the
# expected responses carry the ISO-DEP PCB prefix.
#
# The vector header cannot declare an application, so the application the
# original suite preloaded is created on the wire first, with the same AID and
# key settings. Re-recording the suite against that construction produced a
# byte-identical frame log, including the GetKeySettings response the original
# builds from the live application's key settings (0F 02).

